  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Narrative_InstallableExpertise> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_InstallableExpertise> ;
    narr:childCount "60"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "a3b3776b00e91d42f37e53859ea1cd3275e9dfe7" ;
    narr:narration """This narrative runs the thesis that expertise becomes [installable rather than remembered](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_24), grounded in [a citable-perspective technical moat](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_26), [a rhetorical framing of the target expert market](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_28), [delegation of expert work](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_30), and [an Apple-not-toolbox platform ambition](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_32). A beta thread tests it live: [a Knowledge Packager classification](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_38) [structurally identical to another packager profile](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_37), surfacing [the freeze-after-connect moment](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_58), [a prescription for plainer tool-language prompts](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_60), [backend concepts experienced as entirely foreign](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_63), and [an earlier feedback-capture gap](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_55). A third thread turns on product identity: [the phone-number tagline flagged as incorrect](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_3), [the channel-not-product correction](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_8), [a replacement positioning as curated expertise installation](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_41), and [the structural diagnosis of why the wrong claim keeps re-embedding](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_5), feeding [a temporality-ontology gap](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_33) and [a newly named subgraph-scoping gap](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_36). A later thread adds [independent convergent validation from a working designer](narr:Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_20), [the design-token ↔ perspective parallel](narr:Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_4), [the lens as the irreducible core](narr:Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_10), and [a brand-as-AI-identity endpoint](narr:Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_13). The register across org-lane children runs antithesis-first with analogy and rhetorical-question moves.""" ;
